; This file is designed to test the multi-pass assembler's ability
; to stabilize a complex forward-reference scenario.
;
; It is designed to look like it might oscillate, but due to the
; robust nature of the assembler, it will stabilize in 3 passes.

; The value of 'tricky_label' depends on the address of 'end_label'.
; The address of 'end_label' depends on the size of 'LDA tricky_label'.
; The size of 'LDA tricky_label' depends on the value of 'tricky_label'.

tricky_label = end_label - 1

; We start the code at an address right on the edge of a page boundary
; to maximize the chance of addresses crossing the zero-page boundary.

    ORG &00FD

    LDA tricky_label

.end_label
